  "name": "World Challenge 2000 Best in Japan",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Best in Japan finals of World Challenge 2000, held at the Pokémon Center Tokyo: the senior Secret Super Battle on 19 August and the junior Tropical Mega Battle on 26 August 2000, whose players flew straight on to Hawaii for the International Tropical Mega Battle the next day.\n\nThe top three in each final won a cosmos holo No. 1, No. 2 or No. 3 Trainer card. Each reuses Ken Sugimori's art from the regional trophy cards, but with the winner's own photograph in place of the drawn trainer and their name printed above it, so only one of each was made. Where a winner shows in our pictures, we've blurred their name and face.",
    "sources": [
